(On September 28, 2026, I was issued a written warning by my first level manager after I raised a question) Tj
T* (about how the new shift bid was being applied to my scheduled hours. I had asked for clarification in our) Tj
T* (team meeting and followed up in writing the same afternoon. No other representative on my team who raised) Tj
T* (the same question received any form of discipline. The warning references a performance concern that was) Tj
T* (never documented in my prior reviews, and I was not offered a union representative before the meeting) Tj
T* (moved into a disciplinary discussion.) Tj
